                          8. TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

  ⚠️ COMMON ERRORS:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  ❌ ERROR: "python: command not found"
  ✅ SOLUTION: Install Python
     Termux: pkg install python
     Linux:  sudo apt install python3
     Windows: Download from python.org

  ❌ ERROR: "No module named 'zlib'"
  ✅ SOLUTION: zlib is built-in. Reinstall Python.

  ❌ ERROR: "Permission denied"
  ✅ SOLUTION: Make executable
     $ chmod +x dgtl_protect.py

  ❌ ERROR: "Cannot create folder"
  ✅ SOLUTION: Storage permission
     Termux: termux-setup-storage
     Linux:  Check write permissions

  ❌ ERROR: "DecompressionStream not supported"
  ✅ SOLUTION: Use modern browser
     - Chrome 80+
     - Firefox 113+
     - Edge 80+
     - Safari 16.4+

  ❌ ERROR: "Out of memory"
  ✅ SOLUTION: HTML file too large
     - Reduce HTML size
     - Use smaller files

  ❌ ERROR: "Invalid HTML"
  ✅ SOLUTION: Check HTML syntax
     - Validate HTML
     - Remove special characters

